# Twists and Turns: "When a land you control enters, if you control seven or more lands, transform this enchantment" (CR 603.4, 701.27a), and back it is Mycoid Maze, a Cave land
# (CR 712.8e: no longer an enchantment). Bot1 piles five Forests in on turn 1 with Fastbond (no creature to target, so Twists' enters trigger is never put on the stack), a
# sixth on turn 3 (still an enchantment, the intervening "if" is false at six) and a seventh on turn 5, which transforms it. On turn 5 the Maze taps for {G}; on turn 7 four
# Forests pay {3}{G} and tapping the Maze looks at the top four (Island, Ornithopter, Island, Island): the Ornithopter goes to hand, the rest to the bottom. Tapped for
# mana on turn 5, the Maze cannot also pay {T} for the look: that is refused.

